{"id":"c01f359caf07","publishedAt":1795296608000,"posts":[[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/kinisoku/imgs/4/1/419cc063.jpg"}],[{"text":"リアルにこれあるのすごい。ピンク色だと言い張る女性が作った色が話題に。どう見ても水色にしか見えないとの声が相次ぐ… "},{"text":"https://t.co/QuigNCFQLa"},{"br":1},{"text":"— かぐや姫 (@twf003) "},{"href":"https://x.com/twf003/status/2123550066912948504?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"November 19, 2026"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","href":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2123549933290819584/vid/avc1/1206x2114/_UEA8ZHM-Z_Giw20.mp4","text":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2123549933290819584/vid/avc1/1206x2114/_UEA8ZHM-Z_Giw20.mp4"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/kinisoku/imgs/a/4/a49a2e74.jpg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/kinisoku/imgs/9/e/9e99ccb1.jpg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/kinisoku/imgs/3/c/3c4fd074.jpg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/kinisoku/imgs/a/1/a1f04373.jpg"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/kinisoku/imgs/f/4/f479c562.jpg"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(255, 0, 0)","text":" グレーな "}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":">>2"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":"あっ… "}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":">>2"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 51, 51)","text":"これ"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 51, 51)","text":"ちな色盲 "}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 51, 51)","text":" 調子悪い時の精液やん "}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 51, 51)","text":" そもそも何を作ろうとしてるんだこれは "}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 51, 51)","text":" 水色ってこんなんやっけって思ったらしっかり水色やったわ "}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(204, 51, 51)","text":" 普通にピンクやん "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(255, 0, 0)","text":"★今週のおすすめ"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(255, 0, 0)","href":"http://2ch-c.net/?gt=20260721204601&eid=11132762","text":"【閲覧注意】競輪選手、死去　事故映像が衝撃すぎる・・・・・・"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(255, 0, 0)","href":"http://2ch-c.net/?gt=20260802234601&eid=